&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(注)　「単元未満株式」の欄の普通株式には、自己保有株式が次のとおり含まれております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:40.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;株式会社アミファ　49株&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:IssuedSharesVotingRightsTextBlock>
